the same confusion made on purpose between necromancy, infanticide and theurgy in Gregory of Nazianzus’ accusations against the Emperor Julian.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
